end_date" name="end_date" type="date" min="<?= date('Y-m-d') ?>" required></div><div class="full" data-form-feedback></div><button class="button button-primary full" type="submit">Send booking request</button></div></form><aside class="booking-note"><h2>What happens next</h2><p>The provider sees requested produce, quantity, dates, and a calculated estimate. You receive an in-app notification when the request is approved, rejected, or activated.</p><ul><li>Capacity is checked against the facility’s available space.</li><li>Compatible produce is verified server-side.</li><li>Every booking status is recorded in its history.</li></ul></aside></div></section><?php endif; ?>
